-See Appendix B for more information on tools and how they will handle
+listed in <xref target="section-2" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="Section 2"/>, and deprecated elements are listed in <xref target="section-3" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="Section 3"/>.
+See <xref target="section-appendix.b" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="Appendix B"/> for more information on tools and how they will handle
 deprecated features.</t>
